{"id": "mbpp-585", "input": {"enunciado": "Write a function to find the n most expensive items in a given dataset.", "firma_ejemplo": "assert expensive_items([{'name': 'Item-1', 'price': 101.1},{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}],1)==[{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}]"}, "expected": {"tests": ["assert expensive_items([{'name': 'Item-1', 'price': 101.1},{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}],1)==[{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}]", "assert expensive_items([{'name': 'Item-1', 'price': 101.1},{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}, {'name': 'Item-3', 'price': 45.09}],2)==[{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22},{'name': 'Item-1', 'price': 101.1}]", "assert expensive_items([{'name': 'Item-1', 'price': 101.1},{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}, {'name': 'Item-3', 'price': 45.09},{'name': 'Item-4', 'price': 22.75}],1)==[{'name': 'Item-2', 'price': 555.22}]"], "test_imports": []}}
